File Name: membership_badge.dart

1. Modification Done:

   * Created a visual badge showing membership plan name, status (active/pending), and voting rights when applicable.

2. Purpose of This Modification:

   * Members should see their Life membership status at a glance on the dashboard.

3. How This Modification Is Involved in the Flow:

